933	   * after that it will remove all the duplicated NodeInfo by using the NodeId.
934	   * <p>
935	   * Possible failure:
936	   * <p>
937	   * Client: identical behavior as {@code RMWebServices}.
938	   * <p>
939	   * Router: the Client will timeout and resubmit the request.
940	   * <p>
941	   * ResourceManager: the Router calls each YARN RM in parallel by using one
942	   * thread for each YARN RM. In case a YARN RM fails, a single call will
943	   * timeout. However the Router will use the NodesInfo it got, and provides a
944	   * partial list to the client.
945	   * <p>
946	   * State Store: the Router will timeout and it will retry depending on the
947	   * FederationFacade settings - if the failure happened before the select
948	   * operation.
